cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Bracing for a hit
message: If you use this code or the measurements, please cite it.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Goel
    given-names: Mitanshu
repository-code: https://github.com/mitanshu-2004/go1-brace
abstract: >-
  Two four-legged walking robots trained identically, except one was warned before
  each shove and the other was not. The warning cuts falls fivefold against hard
  shoves. Switching the warning off afterwards leaves that robot far worse than the
  one that never had a warning, so the warning became a crutch rather than an
  addition.
keywords:
  - reinforcement learning
  - legged locomotion
  - push recovery
  - mjlab
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
